### Submit Score
POST {{host}}/score/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{dev_api_key}}

{
  "level_id": "level_001",
  "level_version": 1,
  "game_version": "1.0.0+0001-dev",
  "solution": "SGVsbG8gV29ybGQ=",
  "solution_hash": "47b1ccfc46209749ca88f8ee4556ef7de42cbd94e297a79b3f8efd04ce663588",
  "scores": {
    "time_ms": 12500,
    "striping": 85,
    "fuel": 750,
    "stars": 3
  }
}

### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080
@dev_api_key = dev_key_change_in_production